<title>USA: Alpharma Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Alpharma Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>FORT LEE, N.J. 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>				   December 31,     December 31,</p>
<p>			1996(b)     1995(a)     1996(c)     1995(a)</p>
<p> Total Revenue    $114,717   $138,610    $486,184    $520,882</p>
<p>  -Cost of Sales    78,325     77,071     297,128     302,127</p>
<p> Gross Profit	 36,392     61,539     189,056     218,755</p>
<p>-Selling, General</p>
<p>    &amp; Admin.	  48,032     47,343     185,136     166,274</p>
<p>Operating Income</p>
<p>   (Loss)	   (11,640)     14,196	 3,920	52,481</p>
<p>-Interest Expense</p>
<p>			 (5,046)    (5,129)    (19,976)    (21,993)</p>
<p>  -Other, Net	  (290)	 (45)	 (170)	 (260)</p>
<p>Pretax Income</p>
<p>   (Loss)	   (16,976)	9,022    (16,226)	30,228</p>
<p>-Income Tax</p>
<p>   (Benefit)	 (5,211)	3,353     (4,765)	11,411</p>
<p>Net Income</p>
<p>   (Loss)	   (11,765)	5,669    (11,461)	18,817</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) Per Share</p>
<p>  -Primary	     (.54)	 0.26	(0.53)	  0.86</p>
<p>  -Fully Diluted     (.54)	 0.25	(0.53)	  0.84</p>
<p>Average Shares Outstanding</p>
<p>  -Primary	    21,743     22,100	21,715	21,754</p>
<p>  -Fully Diluted    21,743     22,430	21,715	22,407</p>
<p>(a)  The fourth quarter of 1995 is impacted by $1,776</p>
<p>after tax ($.08) for charges for management actions including severance.  The third quarter of 1995 included net income of $1,754 after tax ($.08) for management actions including the sale of an equity interest in an R&amp;D company net of charges for management actions.  Therefore, for the full year 1995, management actions have no impact.</p>
<p>(b)  The fourth quarter of 1996 is impacted by approximately $3,900 after tax ($.18) for charges for management actions primarily for severance.</p>
<p>(c)  The full year 1996 is impacted by approximately $12,600 after tax ($.58) for charges for management actions for severance and major production rationalization actions.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
